<title>SPAIN: Telefonica leaps higher as Argentaria ups stake.</title>
<headline>Telefonica leaps higher as Argentaria ups stake.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Telefonica rose 3.94 percent on Wednesday to 3,310 pesetas, after Spanish bank Argentaria announced it had raised its stake in the group by 2.12 percent to 5.21 percent.</p>
<p>Argentaria said it did not rule out the possibility that it would raise its stake in the group further.</p>
<p>On Monday, Argentaria carried out four operations after market hours for a total purchase of 20 million Telefonica shares at 3,170 each.</p>
<p>The shares of Telefonica had risen to some 4.5 percent, supassing 3,300 before falling back slightly.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
